    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "d5ed90f3-57aa-4aef-804b-b4dcf01f7e56")
  )
  (text "DBV / SOT-23-5, hand-solder stock lands.\nPin1 NC flag is datasheet-authorized.\nFour functional pins remain genuinely unwired;\nthis package fixture is not a functioning circuit."
    (at 135.89 80.01 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "3b6da4bb-a80f-444c-89cd-ca5b6f2521d8")
  )
  (text "GENERIC LAND DEVIATION: pads1.56×0.65mm at X±1.35; TI example1.10×0.60 at±1.30.\nStock courtyardY±1.8 leaves only0.025mm to maximum mold-flash envelope.\nLater layout MUST reserve Yhalf>=2.025mm for full flash plus0.25mm clearance.\nDevelopment contact mapping only; assembly, mask/stencil and circuit qualification remain open."
    (at 25.4 130.81 0)
